function renderFoodResults(q,local,remote=[]){const host=$('foodSuggestions');if(!host)return;const recent=[],seen=new Set();[...state.foods].reverse().forEach(x=>{const k=x.name.toLowerCase();if(!seen.has(k)&&recent.length<5){seen.add(k);const st=starter.find(f=>f.name.toLowerCase()===k);recent.push(st?{...st,grams:x.grams||100}:{name:x.name,state:x.state||'Packaged',grams:x.grams||100,cal:x.grams?Number(x.calories)*100/x.grams:Number(x.calories)||0,p:x.grams?Number(x.protein)*100/x.grams:Number(x.protein)||0,c:x.grams?Number(x.carbs)*100/x.grams:Number(x.carbs)||0,f:x.grams?Number(x.fat)*100/x.grams:Number(x.fat)||0});}});
 let out='';if(!q&&recent.length)out+='<div class="food-results-heading">Recently logged <small>Tap + to add again</small></div>'+recent.map((x,i)=>foodResultButton(x,i,'recent')).join('');
 if(q&&local.length)out+='<div class="food-results-heading">Foods</div>'+local.map((x,i)=>foodResultButton(x,i,'local')).join('');if(remote.length)out+='<div class="food-results-heading">Online food results</div>'+remote.map((x,i)=>foodResultButton(x,i,'remote')).join('');
 host.innerHTML=out||(q?'<p class="hint">No database match yet. Add the nutrition values once and the app will calculate your portion and include it in today’s calories.</p><form id="quickNutritionForm" class="quick-nutrition-form"><strong>'+esc(q.replace(/\b\w/g,ch=>ch.toUpperCase()))+'</strong><div class="food-portion-two"><label>Amount (g)<input name="grams" type="number" min="1" max="3000" value="100" required></label><label>Calories per 100 g<input name="cal" type="number" min="0" step="0.1" value="0" required></label></div><div class="food-portion-two"><label>Protein (g/100 g)<input name="p" type="number" min="0" step="0.1" value="0" required></label><label>Carbs (g/100 g)<input name="c" type="number" min="0" step="0.1" value="0" required></label></div><label>Fat (g/100 g)<input name="f" type="number" min="0" step="0.1" value="0" required></label><button class="primary" type="submit">Calculate and add to '+esc($('foodMealSelect')?.value||'Breakfast')+'</button></form>':'<p class="hint">Start typing to search, or add a recently logged food.</p>');
 host.querySelectorAll('[data-food-pick]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const list=b.dataset.foodSource==='local'?local:b.dataset.foodSource==='remote'?remote:recent;const food=list[Number(b.dataset.foodPick)];if(food)addNutritionFood(food);});
 const quick=$('quickNutritionForm');if(quick)quick.onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();const d=new FormData(quick),grams=Number(d.get('grams')),factor=grams/100,cal=Number(d.get('cal')),p=Number(d.get('p')),carbs=Number(d.get('c')),fat=Number(d.get('f'));if(![grams,cal,p,carbs,fat].every(Number.isFinite)||grams<=0||[cal,p,carbs,fat].some(x=>x<0)||cal+p+carbs+fat===0){alert('Enter nutrition values greater than zero.');return;}if(saveFoodEntry({auto:true,food:{name:q.replace(/\b\w/g,ch=>ch.toUpperCase()),state:'Manual nutrition / per 100 g',grams,calories:Math.round(cal*factor*10)/10,protein:Math.round(p*factor*10)/10,carbs:Math.round(carbs*factor*10)/10,fat:Math.round(fat*factor*10)/10,meal:$('foodMealSelect')?.value||'Breakfast'}})){$('foodSearch').value='';renderFoodResults('',[]);}};
}
$('foodSearch').addEventListener('input',()=>{const q=$('foodSearch').value.trim().toLowerCase();clearTimeout(foodSearchTimer);const local=findStarterMatches(q);renderFoodResults(q,local);if(q.length<2)return;foodSearchTimer=setTimeout(async()=>{const remote=[];try{const u='https://api.nal.usda.gov/fdc/v1/foods/search?query='+encodeURIComponent(q)+'&pageSize=10&api_key=DEMO_KEY';const r=await fetch(u,{headers:{Accept:'application/json'}});if(r.ok){const d=await r.json();for(const f of (d.foods||[])){const ns=f.foodNutrients||[],get=(ids,...names)=>{const n=ns.find(x=>ids.includes(Number(x.nutrientId))||names.includes(String(x.nutrientName||x.name||'').toLowerCase()));return n?Number(n.value??n.amount)||0:0;};const en=ns.find(x=>[1008,2047,2048].includes(Number(x.nutrientId))&&(!x.unitName||String(x.unitName).toLowerCase()==='kcal'));const kcal=en?Number(en.value??en.amount)||0:get([1008,2047,2048],'energy','energy (kcal)','energy (atwater general factors)');const p=get([1003],'protein');const c=get([1005],'carbohydrate, by difference','carbohydrate');const fat=get([1004],'total lipid (fat)','total lipid');if(f.description&&kcal>=0&&(p||c||fat||kcal))remote.push({name:f.description,state:'USDA · per 100 g',cal:kcal,p,c,f:fat,source:'remote'});}}}catch(_){}try{const u='https://world.openfoodfacts.org/cgi/search.pl?search_terms='+encodeURIComponent(q)+'&search_simple=1&action=process&json=1&page_size=8&fields=product_name,nutriments';const r=await fetch(u,{headers:{Accept:'application/json'}});if(r.ok){const d=await r.json();for(const p of (d.products||[])){const n=p.nutriments||{},k=Number(n['energy-kcal_100g']);if(p.product_name&&Number.isFinite(k))remote.push({name:p.product_name,state:'Open Food Facts · per 100 g',cal:k,p:Number(n.proteins_100g)||0,c:Number(n.carbohydrates_100g)||0,f:Number(n.fat_100g)||0,source:'remote'});}}}catch(_){}if($('foodSearch').value.trim().toLowerCase()!==q)return;const unique=[],seen=new Set();for(const x of remote){const key=x.name.toLowerCase();if(!seen.has(key)){seen.add(key);unique.push(x);}}renderFoodResults(q,local,unique.slice(0,16));},250);});
$('foodMealSelect')?.addEventListener('change',()=>{if(!$('foodSearch').value.trim())renderFoodResults('',[]);});
$('clearFoodSearch')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{$('foodSearch').value='';renderFoodResults('',[]);$('foodSearch').focus();});
